WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:01.750
CHRIS PRATT
Hey, guess what, Marvel fans!

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:06.000
Tickets are on sale right now for
Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3.

00:00:06.051 --> 00:00:06.992
DRAX
[Cheering]

00:00:07.043 --> 00:00:08.070
PETER QUILL
Alright, Guardians.

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.343
Are you ready for one last ride?

00:00:10.407 --> 00:00:12.531
ZOE SALDAÑA
Your favorite group of misfit heroes

00:00:12.607 --> 00:00:16.046
are back as they defend
the galaxy one last time.

00:00:16.273 --> 00:00:17.171
KAREN GILLAN
The stakes?

00:00:18.148 --> 00:00:18.820
SEAN GUNN
Big!

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:19.625
POM KLEMENTIEFF
The action?

00:00:21.094 --> 00:00:21.843
CHRIS PRATT
Big!

00:00:21.894 --> 00:00:22.749
KAREN GILLAN
And Groot?

00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:25.609
ZOE SALDAÑA
Also, big!

00:00:25.668 --> 00:00:27.515
NEBULA
You left out some important information,

00:00:27.566 --> 00:00:30.343
but... That is the gist of it.

00:00:30.485 --> 00:00:32.437
CHRIS PRATT
Get your tickets now for

00:00:32.519 --> 00:00:36.561
Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 3,
only in theaters, May 5th.

